  <!-- EN: unfermented vivi mead -->
  <VV_UnfermentedMead.label>未发酵的薇薇蜜酒</VV_UnfermentedMead.label>
  <!-- EN: It is unfermented vivi mead. Ferment for 10 days at 20-28℃ (68-82℉); otherwise it spoils. -->
  <VV_UnfermentedMead.description>未发酵的薇薇蜜酒，若要发酵，温度应当保持在20-28℃(68-82℉)，否则便会变质。</VV_UnfermentedMead.description>
  
